menu "Application control"

config APP_PR_TRACKING_TIME_US
    int "Anti-windup tracking time (microseconds; 0 disables)"
    range 0 10000000
    default 10000
    help
        Common tracking time for the resonant branches. The initial 10 ms
        value is provisional and must be validated with the physical plant.
        Smaller values produce stronger state correction during saturation.
        Zero reproduces the linear controller with output limiting only.

config APP_FIR_BENCHMARK
    bool "Compare the specific FIR with esp_fir at boot"
    default y
    help
        Before starting the control task, process identical deterministic
        samples through three instances of the original hand-unrolled 15-tap
        filter and the generic symmetric esp_fir kernel. Report the best cycle
        count over nine rounds and the maximum output difference. Disable this
        after collecting target-hardware results to remove the comparison code.

endmenu
